candidate_findings.message:
When Layer 3 (or Layer 2A) has no columns, the generated script is not valid Python and the whole output is unusable. build_layer3 always emits `"mob",
{feat_list},
)`. With an empty `pipeline.layer3` this becomes `select(*["id"], "ts", "mob",
,
)`, which is a SyntaxError. build_layer2a likewise emits `.agg(
{agg_list},
)`, which becomes `.agg(
,
)` (line 125). build_final_join guards `if pipeline.layer3`, but generate() still calls build_layer3 unconditionally. Trigger: `operators_override={Layer2OutputType.NUMERIC: []}` with only numeric columns empties layer3. An `aggregators_override` with no contract-valid aggregator empties layer2a.
